<!--
    Overlay on Playnite Default/Media.xaml.
    Icon set: Phosphor, Light weight (MIT, info/LICENSE-phosphor.txt). The Witcher 3 draws its menu glyphs as thin,
    engraved-looking strokes in parchment white; Phosphor Light is the closest open set to that hairline weight. The
    game's own icons are CD PROJEKT RED artwork and are not bundled. Paths are the SVGs' own on a 256 grid, filled
    nonzero (F1) like the source.

    One geometry per role Playnite's chrome needs (Icon + role), plus the dropdown, submenu and check indicators and the
    game page icons, drawn by IconTemplate in the inherited foreground. IconMainMenu is this theme's own mark, drawn
    by hand: a round medallion (two rings) holding a wolf-head silhouette made of straight cuts. It is not traced
    from the game's medallion or any game file.

    Menu icons Playnite copies (AddGameIcon, PlayIcon, ...) keep Playnite's icofont glyphs; they take the menu's
    foreground, so they come out parchment like the rest of the menu text.
-->
